{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39903","headline":"尚书座上赋牡丹花得轻字韵其花自越中移植 · 徐夤","name":"尚书座上赋牡丹花得轻字韵其花自越中移植","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流苏凝作瑞华精，仙阁开时丽日晴。\n霜月冷销银烛焰，宝瓯圆印彩云英。\n娇含嫩脸春妆薄，红蘸香绡艳色轻。\n早晚有人天上去，寄他将赠董双成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}